        {
          "spotlight": "left-heading"
        },
        {
          "say": "We like football."
        },
        {
          "spotlight": "left-body"
        },
        {
          "say": "We 里有小雨自己，也有她身边的队友。"
        },
        {
          "spotlight": "right-picture"
        },
        {
          "say": "话筒移到组外同学的头像上方。她在介绍同一组。"
        },
        {
          "spotlight": "right-heading"
        },
        {
          "say": "They like football."
        },
